# Supabase MCP 使用规范

## 触发条件

查询数据库、执行 SQL、查看迁移/日志时使用 MCP 工具。

## 安全规则

**UPDATE/DELETE 必须带 WHERE 条件。**

```sql
-- ✅ GOOD：带 WHERE
UPDATE conversations SET status = 'closed' WHERE id = 'xxx';
DELETE FROM conversations WHERE status = 'deleted';

-- ❌ BAD：无 WHERE
UPDATE conversations SET status = 'closed';
DELETE FROM conversations;
```

**操作前先预览。**

```sql
-- 先看影响范围
SELECT COUNT(*) FROM messages WHERE created_at < NOW() - INTERVAL '90 days';

-- 批量删除分批执行
DELETE FROM messages WHERE created_at < NOW() - INTERVAL '90 days') LIMIT 10000;
```

## 常用模板

```sql
-- 查询列表
SELECT * FROM table_name ORDER BY created_at DESC LIMIT 20;

-- 条件查询
SELECT id, title, status FROM conversations WHERE status = 'active';

-- 聚合统计
SELECT status, COUNT(*) FROM conversations GROUP BY status;

-- 添加列
ALTER TABLE table_name ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS col_name VARCHAR(100);

-- 添加索引
CREATE INDEX CONCURRENTLY IF NOT EXISTS idx_name ON table_name (column_name);

-- 修复数据
UPDATE conversations c SET message_count = sub.cnt
FROM (SELECT conversation_id, COUNT(*) as cnt FROM messages GROUP BY conversation_id) sub
WHERE c.id = sub.conversation_id AND c.message_count != sub.cnt;
```

## 事务操作

```sql
BEGIN;
-- 操作
COMMIT;
-- 或 ROLLBACK;
```
